{
  "info": {
    "name": "OpenG2P Aggregation Layer (Beneficiary-360)",
    "description": "The consent-gated, OTP-gated Beneficiary-360 fetch on the Aggregation Layer (`agg_url`, default http://localhost:8110).\n\n## Before you start\n\n```bash\npython postman/agg-prep.py   # signs the consent object, writes the local environment\n```\n\nImport `OpenG2P-Aggregator.local.postman_environment.json` (generated, gitignored), select it, then run the folders in order. Each request saves what the next one needs.\n\n## Two clocks are running\n\n| | expires |\n|---|---|\n| the consent object | 300s (`replay_freshness_window_sec`) |\n| the OTP | 300s (`otp_ttl_sec`) |\n\nRe-run `agg-prep.py` if a seek comes back `replay`.\n\n## Why Postman cannot do all of it\n\nA consent object is an ES256 compact JWS and Postman's sandbox has no ECDSA, so `agg-prep.py` signs it outside and hands it over as `{{consent_jws}}`. Everything else is plain HTTP.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "agg_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8110"
    },
    {
      "key": "callback_receiver",
      "value": "http://localhost:9099"
    },
    {
      "key": "bene360_context",
      "value": "https://schemas.openg2p.org/beneficiary360/v1/context.jsonld"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 Health & discovery",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Service is up",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/ping",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "ping"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('up', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Registry catalog",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/aggregation/v1/registries",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aggregation",
                "v1",
                "registries"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every registry, its scopes (`scopeId` is what a partner consents to), where each block lands in the Beneficiary-360 response and which fields may leave the service. Open by design: no URL, binding or secret.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('catalog returned', () => pm.expect(j.registries).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "(j.registries || []).forEach(r => console.log(r.registryCode + ': ' +",
                  "  r.scopes.map(s => s.scopeId).join(', ')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 Partner - the seek",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Beneficiary-360 seek",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/dci/registry/async/search",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "dci",
                "registry",
                "async",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "description": "A DCI search envelope whose `search_criteria.query` is a Beneficiary-360 request. `header.sender_uri` is the callback; the consent object goes in `authorize.consent_jws`. Answered with an ack; the bene-360 response arrives on the callback as a DCI on-search.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"message_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"message_ts\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n    \"action\": \"search\",\n    \"sender_id\": \"{{partner_audience}}\",\n    \"receiver_id\": \"aggregation-layer\",\n    \"sender_uri\": \"{{callback_url}}\",\n    \"total_count\": 1,\n    \"is_msg_encrypted\": false\n  },\n  \"message\": {\n    \"transaction_id\": \"txn-{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"search_request\": [\n      {\n        \"reference_id\": \"ref-{{$timestamp}}\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n        \"search_criteria\": {\n          \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n          \"query_type\": \"beneficiary360\",\n          \"query\": {\n            \"@context\": \"{{bene360_context}}\",\n            \"foundationalId\": \"{{foundational_id}}\",\n            \"timeframe\": \"Timeframe-Medium\",\n            \"sections\": [\n              \"REGISTRIES\"\n            ],\n            \"correlationId\": \"postman-{{$timestamp}}\"\n          },\n          \"purpose\": {\n            \"code\": \"loan_origination\"\n          },\n          \"authorize\": {\n            \"consent_jws\": \"{{consent_jws}}\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('accepted (202)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const target = pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables;",
                  "if (j.aggregation_id) { target.set('aggregation_id', j.aggregation_id); }",
                  "if (j.correlation_id) { target.set('correlation_id', j.correlation_id); }",
                  "console.log('aggregation : ' + j.aggregation_id);",
                  "console.log('registries  : ' + (j.registries || []).join(', '));",
                  "console.log('scopes      : ' + (j.accepted_scopes || []).length);",
                  "console.log('OTP expires : ' + j.otp_expires_at);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 Subject - OTP and release",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Read the OTP (dev only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/aggregation/v1/requests/{{aggregation_id}}/otp",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aggregation",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{aggregation_id}}",
                "otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Only mounted with AGGREGATION_LAYER_OTP_DEBUG_ENABLED=true."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const target = pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables;",
                  "if (j.otp) { target.set('otp', j.otp); console.log('OTP ' + j.otp); }",
                  "else { console.warn('No plaintext returned. ' + (j.note || '')); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Wrong OTP - refused",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/aggregation/v1/requests/{{aggregation_id}}/verify-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aggregation",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{aggregation_id}}",
                "verify-otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"otp\": \"000000\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('refused', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 409]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "No token - 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/aggregation/v1/requests/{{aggregation_id}}/verify-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aggregation",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{aggregation_id}}",
                "verify-otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The subject's bearer token is required: an aggregation id plus an OTP is not enough.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 without a token', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP (release)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/aggregation/v1/requests/{{aggregation_id}}/verify-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aggregation",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{aggregation_id}}",
                "verify-otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The subject, authenticated by token, releases the data. The fetch is queued; the response goes to the partner's callback.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('released (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('released scopes : ' + (j.released_scopes || []).join(', '));",
                  "console.log('released to     : ' + j.released_to);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 Status and callback",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Request status (subject's own)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/aggregation/v1/requests/{{aggregation_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aggregation",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{aggregation_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "console.log('status: ' + j.status);",
                  "console.log(JSON.stringify(j.registry_results, null, 2));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Queue health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/aggregation/v1/queue",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aggregation",
                "v1",
                "queue"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('queue status', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Last on-search received (dev receiver)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{callback_receiver}}/last",
              "host": [
                "{{callback_receiver}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "last"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`postman/callback_receiver.py` (`agg-callback` in docker-compose).",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const body = j.body || j;",
                  "const rec = (((body.message || {}).search_response || [{}])[0].data || {}).reg_records || [];",
                  "pm.test('a Beneficiary-360 response', () =>",
                  "  pm.expect((rec[0] || {})['@type']).to.eql('Beneficiary360Response'));",
                  "console.log(JSON.stringify(rec[0], null, 2));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 Guard rails",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Another beneficiary than the consent subject - 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/dci/registry/async/search",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "dci",
                "registry",
                "async",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"message_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"message_ts\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n    \"action\": \"search\",\n    \"sender_id\": \"{{partner_audience}}\",\n    \"receiver_id\": \"aggregation-layer\",\n    \"sender_uri\": \"{{callback_url}}\",\n    \"total_count\": 1,\n    \"is_msg_encrypted\": false\n  },\n  \"message\": {\n    \"transaction_id\": \"txn-{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"search_request\": [\n      {\n        \"reference_id\": \"ref-{{$timestamp}}\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n        \"search_criteria\": {\n          \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n          \"query_type\": \"beneficiary360\",\n          \"query\": {\n            \"@context\": \"{{bene360_context}}\",\n            \"foundationalId\": \"someone-else\",\n            \"timeframe\": \"Timeframe-Medium\",\n            \"sections\": [\n              \"REGISTRIES\"\n            ],\n            \"correlationId\": \"postman-{{$timestamp}}\"\n          },\n          \"purpose\": {\n            \"code\": \"loan_origination\"\n          },\n          \"authorize\": {\n            \"consent_jws\": \"{{consent_jws}}\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 subject_mismatch', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('subject_mismatch');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Property bene-360 does not define - 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/dci/registry/async/search",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "dci",
                "registry",
                "async",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The query must validate against the published request.schema.json, which forbids extra properties.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"message_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"message_ts\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n    \"action\": \"search\",\n    \"sender_id\": \"{{partner_audience}}\",\n    \"receiver_id\": \"aggregation-layer\",\n    \"sender_uri\": \"{{callback_url}}\",\n    \"total_count\": 1,\n    \"is_msg_encrypted\": false\n  },\n  \"message\": {\n    \"transaction_id\": \"txn-{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"search_request\": [\n      {\n        \"reference_id\": \"ref-{{$timestamp}}\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n        \"search_criteria\": {\n          \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n          \"query_type\": \"beneficiary360\",\n          \"query\": {\n            \"@context\": \"{{bene360_context}}\",\n            \"foundationalId\": \"{{foundational_id}}\",\n            \"timeframe\": \"Timeframe-Medium\",\n            \"sections\": [\n              \"REGISTRIES\"\n            ],\n            \"correlationId\": \"postman-{{$timestamp}}\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              \"anything\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"purpose\": {\n            \"code\": \"loan_origination\"\n          },\n          \"authorize\": {\n            \"consent_jws\": \"{{consent_jws}}\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('rejected', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 422]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Only PROGRAMS - 422",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agg_url}}/dci/registry/async/search",
              "host": [
                "{{agg_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "dci",
                "registry",
                "async",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "description": "No PBMS is connected, so a query with nothing this service can answer is refused instead of asking the subject for consent to nothing.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"message_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"message_ts\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n    \"action\": \"search\",\n    \"sender_id\": \"{{partner_audience}}\",\n    \"receiver_id\": \"aggregation-layer\",\n    \"sender_uri\": \"{{callback_url}}\",\n    \"total_count\": 1,\n    \"is_msg_encrypted\": false\n  },\n  \"message\": {\n    \"transaction_id\": \"txn-{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"search_request\": [\n      {\n        \"reference_id\": \"ref-{{$timestamp}}\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n        \"search_criteria\": {\n          \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n          \"query_type\": \"beneficiary360\",\n          \"query\": {\n            \"@context\": \"{{bene360_context}}\",\n            \"foundationalId\": \"{{foundational_id}}\",\n            \"timeframe\": \"Timeframe-Medium\",\n            \"sections\": [\n              \"PROGRAMS\"\n            ],\n            \"correlationId\": \"postman-{{$timestamp}}\"\n          },\n          \"purpose\": {\n            \"code\": \"loan_origination\"\n          },\n          \"authorize\": {\n            \"consent_jws\": \"{{consent_jws}}\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
